708,"text":"In this paper, the sensitivity of graphene-based chemiresistor gas sensors, fabricated through inkjet printing, is investigated using different concentrations of graphene in the inks.","source_text_sha256":"1b03dbb818cbfa9687373be6d034d98968ed06e5e12d54386847f91cb999477b"}],"reason":"Curated source-local repetition/explicit alias; conditions and physical instances remain separate.","annotation_status":"HUMAN_REVIEWED","human_review_status":"APPROVED","cannot_link":false},{"decision_id":"f7bdd94c-67ba-519b-947d-eca68047235a","left_mention_id":"8d1242e0-879f-5a41-9fe7-d0e212e062cc","right_mention_id":"eea04fbc-119d-51e5-91ed-624cdffe1244","label":"SAME","evidence":[{"span_id":"544fe366-4fe9-5794-a71d-30663437c92f","document_id":"4a17444d-09e0-4cad-becb-0ad9e9a95b73","revision_id":"94abe07d-65fd-4ac6-96c3-0c65e777ed09","chunk_id":"28d1c15e-e2d5-41b9-96f3-dfb222eb27f1","start":0,"end":267,"text":"Graphene is a good candidate for filling the market requirements for cheap, high sensitivity, robust towards contamination, low noise, and low power consumption gas sensors, thanks to its unique properties, i.e., large surface, high mobility, and long-term stability.","source_text_sha256":"1b03dbb818cbfa9687373be6d034d98968ed06e5e12d54386847f91cb999477b"},{"span_id":"6860e2dd-809a-57ec-aada-34d1ef80934c","document_id":"4a17444d-09e0-4cad-becb-0ad9e9a95b73","revision_id":"94abe07d-65fd-4ac6-96c3-0c65e777ed09","chunk_id":"28d1c15e-e2d5-41b9-96f3-dfb222eb27f1","start":268,"end":524,"text":"Inkjet printing is a cheap additive manufacturing method allowing fast, relatively precise and contactless deposition of a wide range of materials; it can be considered therefore the ideal technique for fast deposition of graphene films on thin substrates.","source_text_sha256":"1b03dbb818cbfa9687373be6d034d98968ed06e5e12d54386847f91cb999477b"}],"reason":"Curated source-local repetition/explicit alias; conditions and physical instances remain separate.","annotation_status":"HUMAN_REV